---
import { ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro'
---

<aside class="page pb-24">
    <a
        href="/archive"
        class="group panel hover:border-foreground/15 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 px-7 py-6 transition-colors"
    >
        <span>
            <span class="text-foreground font-medium">Looking for the topology graph or the workflow builder?</span>
            <span class="text-muted-foreground block text-sm sm:inline sm:pl-1">
                They were part of Pruftnet 0.1, now archived.
            </span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-foreground inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium">
            See Pruftnet 0.1
            <ArrowRight class="size-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true" />
        </span>
    </a>
</aside>
